  "bullets": [
    "GARLIC PARMESAN PRETZEL CHIPS: Snack Factory Garlic Parmesan Pretzel Crisps are all fancied up with savory garlic and zingy Parmesan",
    "THIN AND CRUNCHY: These pretzel thins give you the best part of traditional pretzels without the doughy center for a satisfying crunch in a slim shape",
    "DIP OR NO DIP: Our Garlic Parmesan Pretzel Crisps are flat-out delicious on their own and pair perfectly with veggie and artichoke dips",
    "QUICK AND EASY APPETIZER IDEA: Top these pretzel crackers with tomato, garlic, basil and mozzarella to create tasty You Gotta Burrata bites",
    "PARTY SIZE BAG: This 14-ounce resealable party size bag has about 14 servings and is perfect for sharing or satisfying your cravings for salty snacks",
    "Shelf-stable product."
  ],
  "category": "Dry",
  "description": "Dip or no dip, Snack Factory Garlic Parmesan Pretzel Crisps are flat-out delicious. Our Garlic Parmesan Pretzel Crisps are just like our Original Pretzel Crisps but all fancied up with savory garlic and zingy Parmesan for big flavor in a crunchy snack. A modern, gourmet twist on an old favorite, these thin and crunchy pretzel chips give you the best part of traditional pretzels without the doughy center. They’re perfectly seasoned and baked just right for a hearty, satisfying crunch in a slim, sturdy shape that's dippable, toppable and deliciously snackable. Snack Factory Garlic Parmesan pretzel thins are tasty on their own, pair perfectly with veggie and artichoke dips, and are a great addition to your charcuterie board. Looking for a quick and easy appetizer idea for your next party? Top these flat, thin pretzels with tomato, garlic, basil and mozzarella to create tasty You Gotta Burrata bites. This 14-ounce resealable party size bag contains about 14 servings of pretzel crackers and is perfect for serving to guests or stashing in your pantry to satisfy your cravings for salty snacks. In addition to Garlic Parmesan, Snack Factory Pretzel Crisps are available in other unique flavors such as Everything, Buffalo Wing and Cheddar Cheese. Shelf-stable product.",
